<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="e9ebb2f70ea04c0784e417938e47fa39">分层场景：路由条件组件</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="5aa8115d09064516860c83c00e52d9d3" />
<h1 nodeId="cbc3820a15be4632a38e5c9f722a7a08">一、背景</h1>
<p nodeId="34211ca6113d4e5bb0b54765151ca06e">分层场景与普通场景的核心能力差异在于支持使用短路、路由等部署方法，构造出一个具有层级执行关系的图。这些能力集成在「路由条件组件」中。本文将介绍如何配置该组件。</p>
<h1 nodeId="2293c47c3d1447f9a269fd365b1d7edc">二、名词解释</h1>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="b0c3769d06024a49bb69ec193fea3628">
<tr nodeId="fa3ba03bb21248248f8f81484ae8410f">
<th colwidth="[107]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(0, 55, 166)" nodeId="86faa9d7e2a74628a4647867518a859a">
<p nodeId="0b941eb8b68c46948f78473dd13edd66"><span color="rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span font-size="15">名词</span></span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[915]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(0, 55, 166)" nodeId="0f54370681f8444688eb1a345eab2752">
<p nodeId="99c62b04e7c949559bde9c6b51755d2d"><span color="rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span font-size="15">解释</span></span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="1064c4877bda4e4d9d2d471be2d0fee9">
<td colwidth="[107]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="8f2390c2982347d3aeed15c58bc47b4e">
<p align="center" nodeId="2f5650de601c407fa067240cfa3041eb"><span font-size="15"><a href="https://km.sankuai.com/page/1333731150" title="分层场景" nodeId="a3cccb6b791445a795af9aa10f746803"><strong>分层场景</strong></a></span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[915]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="e120da74e9f14f8e96cb22e3b5d56ecc">
<p align="start" nodeId="229f80a3a7044911969473dd765cfc6a"><span font-size="15">新的规则集合实体，对标过去一个普通场景，在场景内支持以层级关系+路由条件组织成树状的执行链路，使场景内策略达到分层执行的效果。因超时（或短路）未执行的链路将获得</span><span font-size="15"><strong>补偿</strong></span><span font-size="15">。</span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="11b3012cfc8b43c682568c61523f8560">
<td colwidth="[107]" nodeId="c26598f0d76a42d192b6a0226c99b989">
<p align="center" nodeId="262e052b49674123a9590a0bec990d31"><span font-size="15"><strong>路由条件</strong></span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[915]" nodeId="cd3ff80700eb411697f78e9ef6bd3641">
<p nodeId="5281707530ea4818a9844d6886e203bd"><span font-size="14">连接不同层级的策略节点的组件。</span><span color=""><span font-size="14">请求满足分支上的路由条件才能执行对应的下游的策略，类似多级路由中多个路由规则的集成，但不在规则列表中维护，仅归此分层场景所有，不支持跨树共享。在路由条件组件中，可选择启用决策相关的</span></span><span color=""><span font-size="14"><strong>短路条件</strong></span></span><span color=""><span font-size="14">。</span></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="e25580a9ca1448248baddb0fbf19cc69">
<td colwidth="[107]" nodeId="007e23f2a7af46aa96c82ecef6103391">
<p align="center" nodeId="d0d7e518caac4dc1b205ef443873bbab"><span color=""><span font-size="15"><strong>短路条件</strong></span></span></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[915]" nodeId="f1be39fcd0d6439d9a87abacf84de4b0">
<p nodeId="b97b8fa7fb4645bf92fa28dfa9811a65"><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="14">「路由条件组件」里的一个配置项。如果开启短路条件，执行到该节点时会优先判断短路条件是否满足，满足则短路，不再往下路由。不满足则继续判断路由条件来决定是否向下个策略节点路由。</span></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h1 nodeId="6cf1efb143994744b1e46de0fb5993a1">三、使用指南</h1>
<h2 nodeId="44485512eb8b4679a59495d9f7102124">3.1 部署</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="974c8266399e4d37b65357b8c879b990">
<tr nodeId="a283564b0ab846aca8edc03fcf384229">
<th colwidth="[624]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(0, 55, 166)" nodeId="cc16dc80bd4040c1a1593c853ea46a3a">
<p nodeId="e588a71748f8452a8747edab25a61972"><span color="rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span font-size="14"><strong>说明</strong></span></span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[671]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(0, 55, 166)" nodeId="e166cb9b066749dfb829be16b7f46cab">
<p nodeId="103b9334c4c542fa814f0521b5c64d42"><span color="rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span font-size="14">图</span></span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="175a6d7f9a084b0aa2a264a9fa7816e1">
<td colwidth="[624]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="e01b9cfcfda04d87988233215c2f11ab">
<p nodeId="7e089dbd6ac44b0d951a8a1743b0493c">部署操作</p>
<ul nodeId="698b1a5ca51a46f4bdcfc839f7e567d1">
<li nodeId="f3222b5749414cfa94583bdddc8f8d7e">
<p align="start" nodeId="d633939c846340b0956ffa6e73bc650e"><span font-size="14">拖拽：第一个拖进树的组件必须为策略节点。使用引线与上下层的路由条件组件相连。用例测试时，会检验有无断开的节点。成功在屏中拖拽出一个策略组件，将默认展开节点详情（右侧抽屉），在树中单击任意组件，右侧即切换为该组件的详情。</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="72fe4fe0c1984b9f8afdc12327a36096">
<p align="start" nodeId="0f106652c9e0479da107f0c518da4263"><span font-size="14">连线：路由条件组件上下各有一个空心圆，上方可以连接1条线，下方可连n条线。【1进n出，上方只能与策略节点输出连接，下方只能与策略节点输入连接】鼠标点按组件下方的圆形，拖动到下方层组件上方圆形处即可建立连线。</span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="5d203ce8d6bc49e39ec279d9d0625e20">
<p align="start" nodeId="49f3839ed361453587cd10c52f552bf2"><span font-size="14">清除：右键组件，点击删除后将该节点从分层场景中清除。对引线也可右键，点击删除即可删除策略节点之间的连线</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p nodeId="45729e518926429289a0f9a1e7f371f9" />
<p nodeId="253830e47185467f88076d6b9351aa52">基本信息</p>
<ul nodeId="ef5d58de47bf4b20b117ec33be9ff0fb">
<li nodeId="d15f70ac09c042119da7a062f249d3ca"><span font-size="14">名称：可编辑，随时更新。在分层场景保存生效时真正生效。</span></li>
<li nodeId="bd4b1387fb6741d38ecd711a8f183252"><span font-size="14">备注：可编辑，随时更新。在分层场景保存生效时真正生效。</span></li>
</ul>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="efca18a5f4ee43a89a946ade64d05904">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="bfd2c5d5218448eeaea3367e0953502f"><span font-size="14">在组件左侧，有一个数字即为该组件在该分层场景中的编号ID。</span></p>
<p nodeId="d3c223d978754c3e9c099d0fae75900b"><span font-size="14">路由条件配置完成后，可以与下方多个策略节点相连接。需要在对应引线上选择对应判断哪个分支的条件，下方</span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="14">不同引线上不允许选择相同的分支</span></span><span font-size="14">。</span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p align="start" nodeId="037b32571edc43b883260a11efbce129" />
</td>
<td colwidth="[671]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="9cc54c7e69d445d1bf9fc6d4aad45fe4">
<p nodeId="9620517073784589aaa3a7adc61f1eb5"><span font-size="14">选择分支</span></p>
<p nodeId="898e323e7a584124b13b2229662552db"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1341421659/32014219323?contentType=1&amp;isNewContent=false" name="image.jpeg" width="481" height="363" nodeId="93482eec37ac4a72a3664bc9fa6ee50e" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
<h2 nodeId="88c3e614685544d095d4a13d9e8a0591">3.2 短路条件</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="5f32a71e87c449979cd894e79abdb6a7">
<tr nodeId="19cfa079dda3442da35fb832e89cd918">
<th colwidth="[643]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(0, 55, 166)" nodeId="5d12003e3b6546caa262e4efc6977b8b">
<p nodeId="ceb5050ade7c48d8ba230856c57cd7ec"><span color="rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span font-size="14"><strong>说明</strong></span></span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[671]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(0, 55, 166)" nodeId="4ef53e4984414eedb97503487fee57d4">
<p nodeId="f7475922a10c45708d99bce8ee36ae9b"><span color="rgb(255, 255, 255)"><span font-size="14">图</span></span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="7f95e4cc94054cdb98499a91560fa24f">
<td colwidth="[643]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="2560eebdcc3b48669a9a246ab4c25e25">
<p nodeId="da48bb5fb26d4dccbd0fd92f0aaaf9cc"><span font-size="15">1.启用短路条件</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="bd42a655655a4903aaa234c9622f30a7"><span font-size="15">默认不启用。选择「是」则</span><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="15">开启短路条件。</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="83f6a07ed08f48a49138c2a6a64b59e5"><span color="rgb(38, 38, 38)"><span font-size="15">效果：执行到该节点时会优先判断短路条件是否满足，满足则短路，不再往下路由；不满足则继续判断路由条件来决定是否向下个策略节点路由。</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="88a02fb4ad38445b928d38d98e94ff32"><span font-size="15">启用后需要输入关于</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="15">parent_decision_ids的表达式作为判断条件。</span></span></p>
<km-note type="info" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="aa88fcbd316746c49a9d27891601b66c">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="652fd10cac0146f39c40ac04ef7d18e9">请使用Aviator语法输入。短路条件只允许使用系统内置参数<span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)">parent_decision_ids（含义：</span><span font-size="15">上一个策略节点输出的决策ID</span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)">），使用其他参数/因子都会提示报错。</span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<km-note type="tip" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="1e41348818fc4046a3ed76e723d59b03">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="b98da08dc8e54b87b4988f2f801a8cd9">parent_decision_ids为<strong><u>数组类型</u></strong>，其中的元素为int型。例如：[65,25,103]，可参考下方常用例子输入表达式。</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
