<p nodeId="d9f32bb6112241e7b8a772edbb18e887"><span font-size="15">2.测试短路逻辑</span></p>
<p nodeId="358eb61785e44cc7828223f490968a15"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="15">点击【短路条件测试】，可以测试表达式的逻辑执行。在输入框设定该条表达式的输入值，即parent_decision_ids的值，选择执行后期望的输出，即命中与否。</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="63d009be492b467f9ef8b35e0b5d9af7"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="15">点击测试按钮将会告知用户测试的结果为成功还是失败。</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="0f5c4870c5e5452a9af63f76ded296d3"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="15">未进行测试，或是最新测试未通过时，状态为未就绪；</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="0c811245552146a29d94fa4f5f49e144"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="15">最新测试通过时，状态为已就绪。</span></span></p>
<km-note type="tip" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="68a1273e3858497c847d36353a96035e">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="a4571acb01ca448f8f31a7d8b1f14b1c"><span font-size="14">1.此处并不会记录历史的测试结果，仅提示当前测试的通过与否，请在分层场景的「用例测试」环节之前确认短路条件逻辑就绪。</span></p>
<p nodeId="79f78891fd6048f3b30282bd6535ccd0"><span font-size="14">2.短路条件仅允许使用zeus内置的参数parent_decision_ids</span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
