<h2 nodeId="98691e020e414843a83960232cb89d32">3.3 路由条件</h2>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="efbc40b7210b4817a479615580475020">
<tr nodeId="6b80e03b661245bf8a0e85c63d957d5d">
<th colwidth="[643]" bgColor="#0037A6" nodeId="11c4c6345f8647babd767141122b2831">
<p nodeId="15c7f9371e294d0485a10165cee66180"><span color="#FFF"><span font-size="15">说明</span></span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[671]" bgColor="#0037A6" nodeId="541d85c01c474e8c94d9996290958917">
<p nodeId="8b19732008b64b02a52b2e1fba04d59a"><span color="#FFF">图</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="cc07d15789fa4408aaa305a15aab2860">
<td colwidth="[643]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="8f4b2c1f8b144ee280e8f42769a76080">
<p nodeId="79d27dbd502f4018adb0d32a31d2865a"><span font-size="15">1.输入表达式</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="9dbb9a9de9e54dcc9c9b8744a60d7111"><span font-size="15">请使用Aviator语法在路由条件各个分支中输入判断条件。路由条件分支默认至少1个，可以新增删除分支，分支校验不允许空。</span></p>
<p nodeId="d804da815777481e89d93d09698d396d"><span font-size="15">分支表达式的含义即为命中对应条件，即可向该分支指向的下一个策略节点路由。</span></p>
<km-note type="note" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="57abd8d059b148cfaaec750fabb36c2f">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="2fd873db4fd944db84365b66823ef056">注意，路由条件仅支持普通参数，不支持因子与fetcher出参。若配置fetcher出参作为路由，<span color="rgb(255, 74, 71)">执行时将作为空值处理</span>！！</p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
<p nodeId="f51f31bacd82460f9b0c8784a07be49a" />
<p nodeId="6f1254bd60cf401f92e3e1a71a064775"><span font-size="15">2.测试路由逻辑</span></p>
<p align="start" nodeId="df632db240a7486682077ebd32a57c29"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="15">点击【路由条件测试】，可以测试表达式的逻辑执行。</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="9c29b5da69f54430be8deb518f4a2deb"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="15">在输入框设定分支条件的输入值，即各个分支涉及到的参数的值，再填写执行后期望的输出，即命中的分支id的list，</span></span><span color="rgb(245, 35, 45)"><span font-size="15">多个则用逗号（中文英文都可）隔开，例如：分支1，分支2 </span></span><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="15">。</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="c1991b8684d24b7b9f27bf25329d5102"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="15">点击测试按钮将会告知用户测试的结果为成功还是失败。</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="7934abacd08f40fc8f0774f713a36ece"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="15">未进行测试，或是最新测试未通过时，状态为未就绪；</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="fb369a4654df47999e203847349f7ed1"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)"><span font-size="15">最新测试通过时，状态为已就绪。</span></span></p>
<km-note type="tip" hiddenTitle="true" nodeId="e8ed52c7b35b4c17bbd082b0f0c154ec">
<km-title></km-title>
<km-content>
<p nodeId="82be13d47082425d974eaa3f4f518f4a"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"><span font-size="14">1.此处并不会记录历史的测试结果，仅提示当前测试的通过与否，请在用例测试前确认短路条件逻辑就绪。</span></span></p>
<p nodeId="645edef5e62c42aea1adbebd8cea0a8f"><span color="rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9)"><span font-size="14">2.路由条件仅允许使用在zeus上注册过的参数，不允许使用因子。</span></span></p>
</km-content>
</km-note>
</td>
<td colwidth="[671]" verticalAlign="top" bgColor="rgb(255, 255, 255)" nodeId="ea0cd6cb11ec4e008306077e2046b111">
<p nodeId="0b5b0de574554ced8c55fed25915698a"><span font-size="14">测试路由条件的多个分支</span></p>
<p nodeId="8eaa503535a6410fb5b9d7d24bb08819"><img src="https://km.sankuai.com/api/file/cdn/1341421659/32015101603?contentType=1" name="image.jpeg" width="649" height="394" nodeId="d1c50626c59a4ec8ba650627ba02241b" /></p>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
